      <abstract>
      <para>The conversion script provides a streamlined method to migrate an existing installation of &productname; to &productname;. By automating system re-registration, repository subscriptions, and release package replacement, this tool simplifies the transition to SAP-optimized operating environments, enabling administrators to unlock dedicated SAP management capabilities without performing a full system reinstallation].</para>
<para><emphasis>Prerequisites</emphasis></para>
<itemizedlist>
<listitem>
<para>A registered installation of &productname; 16 designated for running SAP workloads</para>
</listitem>
<listitem>
<para>A registration code and email address for &productname;</para>
</listitem>
</itemizedlist>
      </abstract>
